// Market-sizing analysis pipeline — executes the systematic-market-sizing
// skill's 8 steps for one industry and produces a full SizingMatrix (the same
// schema the frozen hydraulic-breaker report renders from), so every analysis
// gets the rich chart report, not just summary cards.
//
// Data provenance rules:
//  - Quantitative content (anchor estimates, region weights, segment mixes,
//    baselines, CAGRs) is generated by the LLM from its market knowledge and
//    marked provenance='llm-estimate' — the UI banners it as unverified until
//    an analyst anchors (step 2) and cross-validates (step 6) it.
//  - Per-step summaries + pendingInputs record exactly what an analyst must
//    confirm before the matrix can be frozen and registry-registered (step 8).
//  - With no LLM configured, completeOrFallback degrades to deterministic
//    synthesis; the pipeline then emits a skeleton matrix flagged for manual
//    completion rather than invented numbers.

